              "type": "text",
              "text": "A standard deck of cards is shuffled and the top and bottom cards are drawn, without replacement. Use card values ace = 1, jack = 11, queen = 12 and king = 13. Find the probability that the two cards sum to",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
